description=Data-driven runtime performance controller for OnePlus Ace 5 Ultra. Five profiles (powersave/balanced/performance/game/system), read-optimized mount, joint app update. Applies only reversible sysfs/procfs tuning; never touches boot/vendor/system partitions; snapshots originals and restores on disable/uninstall.
